Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.49: the top edge light is a gradient that falls off and tapers instead of a ruled 1pt line, and the download button re-renders four times a second so a download's progress ring actually moves.
